{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/LINQ Lambda Expression.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/LINQ Lambda Expression.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"linq lambda expression linq lambda expression","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/LINQ Lambda Expression.md","fileName":"LINQ Lambda Expression.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"LINQ Lambda Expression","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-08 21:16\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[LINQ Query Construction]] [[Functional Programming in C Sharp]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["LINQ Query Construction","Functional Programming in C Sharp","c80andnetcore30moderncross-platformdevelopment.pdf","hands-ondesignpatternswithcandnetcore.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/LINQ Lambda Expression.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/LINQ Lambda Expression.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"linq lambda expression linq lambda expression","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/LINQ Lambda Expression.md","fileName":"LINQ Lambda Expression.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"LINQ Lambda Expression","heading":"LINQ Lambda Expression","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A lambda expression is a compact anonymous function commonly supplied to LINQ operators as a predicate, selector, key function, or accumulator. Its parameters represent items flowing through the query, and its body describes the operation to apply.\n\nThe same syntax may compile to a delegate for in-memory execution or to an expression tree for provider translation. That contextual conversion is central to LINQ's ability to present one query style across very different data sources.\n\nThe inventory example passes a lambda as a product-price criterion to a filtering operation. The filtering mechanism remains unchanged while the lambda expresses the caller's selected business rule, illustrating a functional form of strategy selection.","tags":["baby"],"links":["LINQ Query Construction","Functional Programming in C Sharp","c80andnetcore30moderncross-platformdevelopment.pdf","hands-ondesignpatternswithcandnetcore.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/LINQ Lambda Expression.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/LINQ Lambda Expression.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"linq lambda expression linq lambda expression","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/LINQ Lambda Expression.md","fileName":"LINQ Lambda Expression.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"LINQ Lambda Expression","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[c80andnetcore30moderncross-platformdevelopment.pdf]]\n[[hands-ondesignpatternswithcandnetcore.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["LINQ Query Construction","Functional Programming in C Sharp","c80andnetcore30moderncross-platformdevelopment.pdf","hands-ondesignpatternswithcandnetcore.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}